1
00:00:00,820 --> 00:00:04,910
(Leonard:)...and the longest conversation you've had
with a woman was when your mom called.

2
00:00:09,996 --> 00:00:12,666
Wow, you're just gonna make me
come out and say it, aren't you?

3
00:00:13,083 --> 00:00:14,253
(Leonard:)Say what?

4
00:00:14,417 --> 00:00:16,757
(Howard:)You're weighing me down.

5
00:00:18,797 --> 00:00:22,257
(Howard:)I'm a falcon who hunts better solo.

6
00:00:22,425 --> 00:00:27,265
(Leonard:)Fine, I'll sit here.
You take flight and hunt.

7
00:00:27,931 --> 00:00:30,971
(Howard:)Don't be ridiculous.
You can't just tell a falcon when to hunt.

8
00:00:31,559 --> 00:00:33,849
(Leonard:)Actually, you can.

9
00:00:35,188 --> 00:00:37,778
(Leonard:)There's a whole sport built around it.

10
00:00:39,025 --> 00:00:41,065
(Leonard:)Falconry.

11
00:00:43,780 --> 00:00:45,450
(Howard:)Shut up.

12
00:00:45,865 --> 00:00:48,535
(Howard:)Let's just get Koothrappali and go.

13
00:00:54,207 --> 00:00:56,457
(Howard:)Lucky bastard.

14
00:00:58,503 --> 00:01:00,793
It's gotta be that stupid accent of his.

15
00:01:03,883 --> 00:01:06,803
[IN INDIAN ACCENT]
Hello, I'm Sanjay Wolowitz from Bombay.

16
00:01:09,681 --> 00:01:11,511
[IN NORMAL VOICE]
Okay, I'm stumped.

